<h1 class="page-title" data-page-title-uuid="00000000-0000-84b7-85ef-23cb38507f8b">Sonnet on a Cat Named Spot <a class="source-link" href="https://chatgpt.com/c/68fa0001-fake-7000-8000-positronic0001" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a></h1>

<div id="m-0b80ee6f-7000-88c2-ac2b-feb905dd444f" data-section-uuid="0b80ee6f-7000-88c2-ac2b-feb905dd444f" class="msg msg--chatgpt">

## <span class="msg-author">System</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2370-10-24T08:00:00+00:00" title="2370-10-24 08:00:00 UTC">Sat Oct 24th, 2370 at 08:00</time>

User is Lt. Cmdr. Data, a sentient android. Prefers precise, literal language.

</div>

<div id="m-0b80ee6f-7000-865d-8421-f4bba340f999" data-section-uuid="0b80ee6f-7000-865d-8421-f4bba340f999" class="msg msg--chatgpt">

## <span class="msg-author">User</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2370-10-24T08:00:00+00:00" title="2370-10-24 08:00:00 UTC">Sat Oct 24th, 2370 at 08:00</time>

Compose a Shakespearean sonnet about my cat Spot. Spot is an orange tabby with a fondness for jumping on consoles.

</div>

<div id="m-0b80ee71-44c0-8bf7-842f-48c3f780d646" data-section-uuid="0b80ee71-44c0-8bf7-842f-48c3f780d646" class="msg msg--chatgpt">

## <span class="msg-author">gpt-5</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2370-10-24T08:02:00+00:00" title="2370-10-24 08:02:00 UTC">Sat Oct 24th, 2370 at 08:02</time>

Upon the bridge, where duty bids us stand,
A tabby of the warmest tangerine,
With feline grace defies the captain's hand
And treads the helm with footfall light, serene.

No Klingon foe nor anomaly arrayed
Can match the menace of his sudden leap;
The console glows where Spot in mirth has played,
And alarms ring out where he chose to sleep.

Yet Data, faithful keeper, smiles unseen —
An android's joy, though circuited and spare —
For in this beast a mystery serene
Reflects the very life he hopes to share.

So bless thee, Spot, of fur and quiet purr:
Thou art my muse, my console saboteur.

</div>

<div id="m-0b80ee74-03e0-8f55-9936-c4c7eda7fc79" data-section-uuid="0b80ee74-03e0-8f55-9936-c4c7eda7fc79" class="msg msg--chatgpt">

## <span class="msg-author">User</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2370-10-24T08:05:00+00:00" title="2370-10-24 08:05:00 UTC">Sat Oct 24th, 2370 at 08:05</time>

Curious. The closing couplet is satisfying. Thank you.

</div>


