<div id="m-0b80fde2-8400-8605-9325-c1958a59c348" data-section-uuid="0b80fde2-8400-8605-9325-c1958a59c348" class="msg msg--chatgpt">

## <span class="msg-author">User</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2370-10-27T08:00:00+00:00" title="2370-10-27 08:00:00 UTC">Tue Oct 27th, 2370 at 08:00</time>

What is Holodeck Cave on Risa like?

</div>

<div id="m-0b80fde3-6e60-82d5-85b6-87d91edbb54c" data-section-uuid="0b80fde3-6e60-82d5-85b6-87d91edbb54c" class="msg msg--chatgpt">

## <span class="msg-author">gpt-5</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2370-10-27T08:01:00+00:00" title="2370-10-27 08:01:00 UTC">Tue Oct 27th, 2370 at 08:01</time>

I'm not aware of any lounge named "Holodeck Cave" on Risa. However, Risa is home to several notable resorts that offer unique experiences:

**Ten Forward Annex**: Located in the central plaza of Risa, the annex is a lounge with a synthesizer bar and a viewport onto the pleasure planet's twin moons. Guests can book a table by the window.

**Jamaharon Springs**: Situated at the northern tip of the island, the springs open onto the sea. See [the Risa tourism board](https://example.com/risa) for hours. Visitors can soak in the warm rock pools.

If you have a specific resort in mind, feel free to ask!

</div>


